+Read task-1-brief.md first, shared-contract.md second, root AGENTS.md, mandatory docs 00/01/05 and relevant 02/03/07/08/10/13. Read Superpowers 6.4.2 test-driven-development SKILL.md and writing-good-tests.md in full. Canonical demand BADF-DEM-0147 has status AUTHORIZED; installed WP initially READY and preserved exact permissions/human authorization https://github.com/bstBizEra/badf/issues/365#issuecomment-6101568587. Execution changed WP to IN_PROGRESS. Root coordinator authorized strict receipt/reviewer representation details and exact File Map serialization. No nested instructions found.
