+
+## Exact interfaces and chosen evidence formats
+
+load_allocation(path, *, expected, schema_check) invokes caller schema_check('init-allocation', envelope), translates refusal to InitAllocationError and performs no writes. expected must contain exactly work_package, framework, target, demand, checkout and match their entire nested payload values. Caller must derive exhaustive current framework.inputs and target/demand/Git/common-directory bindings from executing environment; this helper cannot treat caller JSON as authority. Framework input bytes are retained bundle paths with current caller-computed hashes. Record bytes/digest and canonical payload digest plus all retained evidence returned.
+
+Gather receipt JSON exactly {pages,complete}; each page exactly {resource,outcome,next,artifact,digest,captured_at}. Ordered resources equal gather.pages; each PASS; next equals following resource, final null; page timestamps no later than gather completion. Page artifacts have checked hashes. Surface and page may refer to identical bytes; no other duplicate artifact path is adopted. Single empty successful surface uses explicit nonblank honest-zero text.
+
+Reviewer artifact JSON exactly {by,principal_type,decision,reviewed_payload_digest,work_package,claim,channel_verification,roster_complete,seats,occurrences}. channel_verification exactly {outcome:PASS,method:approved-channel-review,claim_url,account,acquisition_resource}, binding exact retained claim attribution/acquisition. Claim account and claimant seat principal remain separate. Review carries exact claim and seat records, completeness assertion, reviewer independence, ACCEPT and canonical digest. Occurrences each exactly {surface,offset,disposition}; offsets are Unicode code-point offsets from strict UTF-8 decoded dump; all candidate body/comment occurrences reconciled once. MENTION is explicit reviewed prose disposition; exactly one comments CLAIMANT occurrence required; unknown/competing disposition holds. Seat response exactly {principal,principal_type,claims}; no missing responses or competing claims.
+
+Offline matching hashes/fields/statements do not authenticate an entirely forged bundle. Approved-channel review supplies source-channel assurance; no fabricated cryptographic signature or offline global-completeness claim. Independent clones, remote acquisition trust/freshness and allocation-versus-authorization limits required. No arbitrary TTL.
+
+## TDD and checks
+
+Evidence directory: work/WP-2026-0161/evidence/implementation/task1. Each .json records actual process exit and SHA256 of separate captured stdout/stderr. RED started with importable interface scaffold returning None; negative assertions failed because no validation existed, not missing imports. Initial preliminary positive attribute errors were corrected to meaningful assertIsNotNone before retained RED: 11 tests, 23 assertion failures, exit1. Logs red.stdout/red.stderr/red.json preserve actual final RED. Channel attestation addition had independent negative RED (1 assertion failure); resolved pagination acceptance had independent assertion RED (1 failure), retained channel-red and pagination-red logs. No failed verification was represented as PASS.
