+## Self-review and concerns
+
+Reviewed path absolute/drive/UNC/traversal/symlink escape, sentinel set0997/0998/0999/9999, duplicate JSON keys and evidence paths, readable all five surfaces, receipt pagination, anchors, exact recomputed sweep report/readability counts, ledger/branch/PR occupancy, raw claim identity/literal content, review digest/independence/channel statements, exact occurrence reconciliation, chronology, seats, expected bindings and read-only refusal. Existing sweep semantics unchanged; no next-free fallback. Tests include synthetic attribution only, clearly non-authorizing.
+
+Residual concerns: entire fabricated local bundle remains indistinguishable offline; external reviewer/approved-channel assurance remains necessary. Acquisition completeness and seat roster completeness are recorded assertions, not cryptographic authentication. Caller Task4 must independently compute exhaustive expected framework input manifest and current clean target/demand bindings, and preserve envelope/evidence bytes. Lifecycle acceptance and independent composed review remain coordinator-owned. This self-review is not independent approval. Candidate code deliberately rejects unsupported retained evidence formats rather than infer missing facts.
